{"id":"2a2a5f632a428dbe","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency.md","title":"每个固定码界的一致性实例可在 PRA 验证","display":"thm-each-finite-code-consistency — 每个固定码界的一致性实例可在 PRA 验证","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency","aliases":["72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency"],"display":"thm-each-finite-code-consistency — 每个固定码界的一致性实例可在 PRA 验证","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §6 finite consistency and Ch.II §2, print577–579,113–118/PDF589–591,125–130; local finite verification","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-each-finite-code-consistency — 每个固定码界的一致性实例可在 PRA 验证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"245122d1b4e24cdf\" href=\"?note=245122d1b4e24cdf\" title=\"72-df-finite-code-consistency\">72-df-finite-code-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §6 finite consistency and Ch.II §2, print577–579,113–118/PDF589–591,125–130; local finite verification"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>T、κ 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"245122d1b4e24cdf\" href=\"?note=245122d1b4e24cdf\" title=\"72-df-finite-code-consistency\">72-df-finite-code-consistency</a> 的数语法接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)\\)</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA}\">\\(\\mathsf{PRA}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a>，其语言包含检查程序对应的 PR 函数及定义方程。n∈ω。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\\mathsf{PRA}\\vdash_2^{(1)}\n\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(\\overline n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\\mathsf{PRA}\\vdash_2^{(1)}\n\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(\\overline n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一致性使每个标准 p&lt;n 的检查结果不为1。每次具体 PR 计算都由程序定义方程给 PRA 中的有限证明；对固定标准 n，算术中的有限初段枚举把这些逐码结果合并为有界全称句。n=0 的前件恒假。量词“每个 n 都有一份证明”属于元语言，未提供由 PRA 证明的统一全称句，也没有给这些证明的多项式长度界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-code-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"245122d1b4e24cdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-code-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"245122d1b4e24cdf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"T、κ 为 [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] 的数语法接口，$\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)$ 成立；$\\mathsf{PRA}$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]，其语言包含检查程序对应的 PR 函数及定义方程。n∈ω。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"T、κ 为 [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] 的数语法接口，$\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)$ 成立；$\\mathsf{PRA}$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]，其语言包含检查程序对应的 PR 函数及定义方程。n∈ω。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\\mathsf{PRA}\\vdash_2^{(1)}\n\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(\\overline n).","display":true}],"bytes":1762,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-po